    "title": "University of Memphis implements new stadium seating system - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Kozlowski ,\n12 hours ago MEMPHIS, Tenn. (WMC) - The University of Memphis has implemented a new section and row numbering system ahead of the upcoming football season. The main concourse will now serve as a break between levels. Seating below the concourse will remain in the 100-level sections, while seating above the concourse will now be designated as 200-level sections. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
